&lt;h2&gt;Watch agent SSH sessions live&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Agent SSH sessions open a live tab you can watch and type in.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Live agent tabs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;See each command an agent runs and its output as it happens, and type in the same session yourself.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clearer agent errors&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;A denied agent request now says why, such as missing or outdated permission.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Double-click bookmarks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Double-click a bookmark to open an SSH tab.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class="notice"&gt;Close active sessions before updating. Requires macOS 13 or later on Apple Silicon.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/PROMLEE/promeftp/releases/tag/v1.1.13"&gt;Read the full release notes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
